<title>HONG KONG: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Yageo.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on Yageo.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said it has launched 5.0 million American-style call warrants on shares of Yageo Corp.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	NT$55.50     PREMIUM	 18.35 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 NT$10.1843   GEARING	 5.45X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  02.OCT.97    PAYDATE	 TO BE ANNOUNCED</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG   MIN EXER LOT  5,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    NT$55.50</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
